              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this and it turned out great! I exchanged brown sugar for the white sugar and just brushed the top of my pie crust with a little bit of butter to help it get more golden brown.",
            "datePublished": "2020-03-20T22:04:08.210Z"
